# Historia de Usuario: Acceder a la cámara (TX-101)

## 1. Diagrama Estático (MVVM + Servicios)

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class CameraView {
        +CameraViewModel viewModel
        +body View
    }

    class CameraViewModel {
        +CameraViewState state
        +checkAndRequestPermission() async
        +retryPermission() async
    }

    class CameraServiceProtocol {
        <<interface>>
        +checkPermission() async -> CameraAuthorizationStatus
        +requestPermission() async -> Bool
        +configureSession() async throws
    }

    class AVCameraService {
        -AVCaptureSession captureSession
        -AVCaptureDeviceInput deviceInput
        +checkPermission() async -> CameraAuthorizationStatus
        +requestPermission() async -> Bool
        +configureSession() async throws
    }

    class CameraViewState {
        <<enumeration>>
        idle
        loadingPermission
        denied(reason: String)
        error(CameraError)
        ready
    }

    class CameraAuthorizationStatus {
        <<enumeration>>
        notDetermined
        restricted
        denied
        authorized
    }

    CameraView --> CameraViewModel : Observe / Binds
    CameraViewModel --> CameraServiceProtocol : Injected Service
    AVCameraService ..|> CameraServiceProtocol : Implements
    CameraViewModel --> CameraViewState : Manages
    CameraServiceProtocol --> CameraAuthorizationStatus : Returns
